Fri Oct 23 16:35:43 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.2.1:
  * 1.2.0: support device names with a hexadecimal PCI domain name
  * 1.2.0: allow overriding the driver info path via LIBOCXL_SYSPATH
  * 1.2.0: documentation and Makefile/build enhancements
  * 1.2.0: add tests for debug AFUs (memcpy, afp)
  * 1.2.1: set the library version correctly
  * 1.2.1: fix the test build
- Drop remove_2_backslashes_in_shell_call.patch: fixed upstream by
  reworking the header check for make 4.3 escape handling
- Add BuildRequires: make
- Retarget _service to 1.2.1 and switch tar_scm/recompress to
  mode="manual"
- Spec cleanup: drop obsolete Group: tags

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Jun 16 13:46:05 UTC 2020 - Michel Normand <normand@linux.vnet.ibm.com>

- Update to version 1.1.0
   Requires Linux headers >= 4.18 to compile
   Add support for POWER9 wake_host_thread/wait
   Generate warnings on ignored return values
   Use opaque structs rather than void pointers for ocxl handles
   Verified GCC 4-8 & Clang 3.6.2-6.0.1 produce correct machine code for OpenCAPI, and whitelisted them
   Verify & enforce that we compile with strict ANSI C (2011)
  -details upstream https://github.com/OpenCAPI/libocxl/releases
- Add remove_2_backslashes_in_shell_call.patch
- Add add_missing_ocxl_header_from_glibc_devel_in_leap.patch

